# Daily Report Automator - cron example
# Install with:  crontab -e   (paste the line below, adjust the path)
#
# Fields: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
# Runs Monday-Friday at 07:30 server time:
30 7 * * 1-5 /absolute/path/to/daily-report-automator/scripts/run_daily.sh

# Every day at 18:00:
# 0 18 * * * /absolute/path/to/daily-report-automator/scripts/run_daily.sh
#
# Tip: cron uses a minimal environment, so the wrapper script activates .venv and
# the app loads credentials from the project's .env file.
